      "id": 1,
      "text": "In 1925, Crystal Lakes officially formed a not‑for‑profit association, turning the area into a quiet haven for families.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.crystallakespoa.org/about-us",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Farmland and woodland gradually gave way to a charming lakeside neighborhood with winding roads, modest homes, and a strong sense of togetherness.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.crystallakespoa.org/about-us",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Four glacier‑carved kettle lakes—Main, North, South, and Hidden—interconnect via natural channels, with Main Lake covering about 20 acres and reaching depths of 40 feet.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22,
        23,
        24,
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.crystallakespoa.org/about-us",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Developed around man‑made lakes in the 1960s, Crystal Lakes functions mainly as a residential area with private lake access for homeowners.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.trawellino.com/destinations/united-states/ohio_crystal-lakes",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 2008, the Bethel Township Board of Trustees received a $45,000 block grant to build a parking lot and gazebo at Crystal Lakes Park.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crystal_Lakes%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
